    {
      "question": "How do I choose a unique girl dog name?",
      "answer": "Skip the top ten (Poppy, Luna, Bella and friends) and look at old-fashioned human names like Agnes or Maud, food names like Pavlova, or something grand like Boudica. Check it's still short enough to call, or has a short version."
    },
    {
      "question": "How do I choose a dog name?",
      "answer": "Pick something one or two syllables long, with a clear first sound, that doesn't rhyme with a command like sit, stay or no. Say it out loud a few times before you decide."
